Title: Literature Review — Structural and Thermal Design of Electric Two‑Wheeler Battery Enclosures

Authors / Compiled by: [Your name]
Date: 2026-09-13

1. Executive summary
This literature review summarizes recent (2015–2025) peer‑reviewed research and relevant standards for the structural and thermal design of battery enclosures for electric two‑wheelers (ETWs). It highlights material comparisons (aluminum vs polymers/composites), FEM and modal analysis practices, thermal‑runaway mitigation strategies, test protocols, and design implications for ETW applications.

